```

Examples: `countDoubles("abacbca")` returns 0 and `longestRun("abacbca")` returns 1; `countDoubles("bcbaaccc")` returns 3 and `longestRun("bcbaaccc")` returns 3; `countDoubles("bccaaa")` returns 3 and `longestRun("bccaaa")` returns 3.

